---
// Feature cards grid (9 features)
---

<section id="features" class="py-20 px-4">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14" data-reveal>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">Features</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mt-3 text-white">Todo lo que necesitas.<br/>Nada que sobre.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
      {[
        { icon: '🤖', title: 'AI Agent Playground', desc: 'Chat multi-modelo con tools, code execution y streaming. Para developers y no-developers.' },
        { icon: '🧠', title: 'Persistent Memory', desc: 'Memoria cross-session con búsqueda híbrida FTS + vector. Lo que aprendes no se pierde.' },
        { icon: '🔄', title: 'Agent Orchestration', desc: 'Sub-agentes jerárquicos con DAG workflows. Delega tareas complejas a tu ejército de agents.' },
        { icon: '🏢', title: 'Enterprise Admin', desc: 'RBAC granular, SSO (SAML/OIDC/SCIM), audit trails inmutables. Lo que compliance necesita.' },
        { icon: '🌐', title: 'Multi-model Gateway', desc: 'BYOM (Bring Your Own Model). Routing inteligente por costo y latencia. Fallback automático.' },
        { icon: '📊', title: 'Knowledge Base', desc: 'Conecta wikis, docs, repos, Jira, Notion, Confluence. Tu contexto siempre disponible.' },
        { icon: '🛠️', title: 'Non-dev Agents', desc: 'Agentes pre-construidos para soporte, operaciones y data analysis. Sin código.' },
        { icon: '🔒', title: 'On-prem Option', desc: 'Data sovereignty, SOC2, despliegue en tu infraestructura. Para empresas reguladas.' },
        { icon: '📦', title: 'Marketplace', desc: 'Plugins, templates e integraciones. La comunidad construye sobre NexusMind.' },
      ].map((f, i) => (
        <div class="feature-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay={i * 80}>
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">{f.icon}</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-white mb-1">{f.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">{f.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .feature-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .feature-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59,130,246,0.08), transparent 60%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.4s;
  }
  .feature-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .feature-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.2); }
</style>
